---
import GridOverlay from './GridOverlay.astro';
---
<section id="funcionalidades" class="relative py-24">
  <GridOverlay />
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 relative">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center fade-in opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-700">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-navy">
        Menos trabajo manual. Más control sobre tu información.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 divide-y divide-gray-200">
      <div class="group flex items-start gap-6 py-7 fade-in opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-700">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-brand transition-colors duration-300">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="text-brand group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <path d="M4 4h16v16H4z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M8 9h8M8 13h5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-navy text-lg">Extracción inteligente</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-graytext">Está pensado para extraer automáticamente información relevante de las facturas.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group flex items-start gap-6 py-7 fade-in opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-700">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-brand transition-colors duration-300">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="text-brand group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <path d="M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-navy text-lg">Detección de errores</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-graytext">Busca ayudar a identificar posibles inconsistencias en la información extraída.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group flex items-start gap-6 py-7 fade-in opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-700">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-brand transition-colors duration-300">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="text-brand group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <path d="M4 16V6a2 2 0 012-2h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-navy text-lg">Detección de duplicados</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-graytext">Permitirá facilitar la identificación de facturas que podrían haber sido registradas anteriormente.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group flex items-start gap-6 py-7 fade-in opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-700">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-brand transition-colors duration-300">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="text-brand group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <path d="M21 21l-4.35-4.35" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-navy text-lg">Búsqueda de facturas</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-graytext">Diseñado para encontrar información de los documentos de forma más sencilla.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group flex items-start gap-6 py-7 fade-in opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-700">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand/10 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-brand transition-colors duration-300">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="text-brand group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <path d="M12 3v12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l4-4M4 17v2a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2v-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-navy text-lg">Exportación a Excel</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-graytext">Podrás preparar la información estructurada para continuar trabajando con ella.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>